	(lib_symbols)
	(text "MCU block. To draw here:\nESP32-A1S (ES8388; codec I2C/I2S are inside the module), 22u + 100n, EN 10k + 1u,\nBoot and Reset buttons, 10k pull-ups on GPIO36/39, 10k pull-down on GPIO12 (LED),\ndisplay: SCK 14, MOSI/SDA 13, CS 15, DC 22; 4.7k pull-ups on 13/14 fitted for I2C only.\nCHRG 4, STDBY 2. Unused: MIC/LINEIN pins."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
